          {dlOrder(S.pen, S.ghost).length <= (lang === "en" ? 9 : 7) && <text x={PEN.x1 - 26} y={PEN.y + PEN.h / 2 + 10} textAnchor="end" fontSize={T.micro} fontWeight={600} fill={C.ink}>{tx("factor pen")}</text>}
